.claude-accounts
{{/* Provider API keys (refuseless, yeta, ...) that models.json reads through
     its "!" apiKey command, after the provider's environment variable. No
     template provides this path and it holds only secrets, so listing it
     makes an accidental `chezmoi add` refuse instead of committing a key.
     See docs/pi-models.md. */}}
.config/pi/**
{{/* aiforui.dev install token, read by run_after_29-install-aiforui-skills.
     The skills it installs are paid content and stay unmanaged too. */}}
.config/aiforui/**
